@format fwcollab.symbol_map.v3
@id V4-L2-008
@title constructive L2 full-mechanism curriculum 008; freeze-thaw route
@max_steps 1
@controller c1_plate plate at 6,5 accepts W
@actuator a1_platform platform at 2,9 controlled_by all(c1_plate)
@controller c2_plate plate at 3,14 accepts F
@actuator a2_door door at 7,18 controlled_by all(c2_plate)
@thermal I initial liquid heater H freezer K
